  "description": "“Can the Earth that's been devastated by the sudden appearance of monsters, find peace once again?\"\n\nOne day, an unknown virus spreads, and mutants appear all over the nation, attacking people.\nYeo Hwarang, who had been living a peaceful life until that day, loses his mother to a mutant. The shock of that loss causes him to awaken as a mutant himself...\n\nAfter becoming a mutant, he decides to live to punish the mutants who killed his mother.\n\nHowever…\nThe mutants, who were thought to be unintelligent monsters, begin to show wicked intentions of wanting to dominate over the humans…\nWill Yeo Hwarang be able to stop the mutants and restore the peace for humankind?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**      \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4771017475), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65802468), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12126878), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/punchman), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/drillpunchman), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000072674), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/8873), [Toptoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/D_fiffrenchi?p_id=pp_1601_001) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/202901)",
